  # - Enemy

values:

#Level
- StartLevel: IValue<int>
- MaxLevel: IValue<int>
- CurrentLevel: IReactiveVariable<int>
- LevelRepository: ILevelRepository

# Menu
- MenuLoadedEvent: IEvent

#Game
- GameContextPrefab: GameContext
- GameUIPrefab: GameUI